'''Bath'rah the Windwatcher''' is a [[jungle troll]] [[shaman]] located at the [[Chillwind Point]] ruins in the [[Alterac Mountains]]. He is a weaponcrafter who has taken up the life of a hermit. A great elemental creature known as the [[Cyclonian]] lived in the ruins and Bath'rah desired to use the heart of the creature to make a great weapon. He hoped that one day he'd find a champion to defeat the elemental.

{{Legion-section}}
During the [[third invasion of the Burning Legion]], he joined the [[Earthen Ring]] at the [[Maelstrom]]. He was initially seen in the [[Storm's Eye Overlook]] where he was working on a [[Damp Campfire]]. Afterward, he gives [[Seal of Broken Fate]] in exchange for [[Order Resources|order resources]] after learning the skill from [[Goldmine]].

