For years I watched and waited at the base of the Alterac Mountains, speaking only to the spirits and forging mighty weapons from elemental power.

I know the whims of the spirits. I know that one's destiny can be guided and shaped, if one is willing to make the sacrifice for it.

Farseer, build up this sacred space, and I promise to give you the power to shape your own fate.

Until then, I watch. I wait.
