'''Cyclonian''' is an [[air elemental]] summoned by [[Bath'rah the Windwatcher]] in the [[Alterac Mountains (Classic)|Alterac Mountains]]. He is referred to as a wind lord.<ref>[[Cyclonian (quest)]]</ref> Bath'rah can use Cyclonian's heart to create ''Whirlwind'' weapons for [[warrior]]s.

==Abilities and strategy==
*{{Abilities|Gust of Wind|id=6982|[[Stun]]s nearby enemies, rendering them unable to move or attack for 4 sec.|icon=spell_nature_earthbind}}
*{{Abilities|Knock Away|id=18670|Inflicts normal damage plus 30 to an enemy and [[Knock back|knocks]] it back.|icon=inv_gauntlets_05}}
*{{Abilities|Whirlwind|id=17207|Attacks nearby enemies in a whirlwind of steel that lasts 2 sec. and inflicts normal damage plus 50.|icon=ability_whirlwind}}

Like other air elementals, his attacks cause nature damage instead of physical. He has a whirlwind attack, as well as a knockback that will send you flying. If you land in the nearby stream, his health will reset, so position yourself so that this won't happen.

==Objective of==
*Drops [[Whirlwind Heart]] for [[The Summoning]].

