'''Lord Jorach Ravenholdt''' is a [[human]] [[rogue]] and the lord of the [[Ravenholdt|Assassin's League]], which welcomes only those of extraordinary prowess into its fold. During the [[third invasion of the Burning Legion]] on [[Azeroth]], Jorach was revealed to be the leader of the [[Uncrowned]], a secret organization of rogues once located in the [[Hall of Shadows]], in the depths of [[Dalaran]]'s [[Underbelly]].

==History==
At some point after the [[Third War]], Lord Ravenholdt accepted the [[SI:7]]'s aid in routing out the [[Syndicate]] affliction who wandered the part of the Highlands where his headquarter is located, housing the base of operations out of his [[Ravenholdt Manor|manor]].<ref name="Exploring Azeroth">''[[World of Warcraft: Exploring Azeroth: The Eastern Kingdoms]]'', pg. 71</ref>

