The '''Strange Snowman''' is a [[snowman]] located outside the [[Growless Cave]] in the [[Alterac Mountains]] during the [[Feast of Winter Veil]]. He is actually a [[goblin]] agent of [[Smokywood Pastures]] named '''Sacks''' who was sent to Alterac to look for a missing shipment of holiday treats<ref>[[Stolen Winter Veil Treats]]</ref> and got frozen in snow by [[the Abominable Greench]].<ref>[[You're a Mean One... (Alliance Classic)]] / [[You're a Mean One... (Horde Classic)]]</ref> After adventurers defeat the Greench, Smokywood Pastures sends a mail informing them that they sent a team to unfreeze Sacks, and in doing so developed a [[:Winter Veil Disguise Kit]] allowing people to voluntarily turn into snowmen.<ref>[[Winter Veil Disguise Kit]]</ref>

