[[File:The Abominable Greench TWW.jpg|thumb|The Abominable Greench.]]

'''The Abominable Greench''' is an elite [[yeti]] and the main boss of the [[Feast of Winter Veil]]. He has stolen shipments of treats from [[Smokywood Pastures]] and stuffed them in his lair, [[Growless Cave]] in the [[Alterac Mountains]] (in northern [[Hillsbrad Foothills]]) along with a variety of stolen toys and holiday items, as well as kidnapped [[Metzen the Reindeer]].<ref>[[You're a Mean One...]]</ref> The Greench is served by [[Rotten Little Helper]]s who've become fed up with working for [[Greatfather Winter]].<ref>[[Rotten Helper Box]]</ref>

==Objective of==
When the Greench is killed, [[Stolen Treats]] will appear near the cave and [[Metzen the Reindeer]] will be freed, both required for [[You're a Mean One...]]. Players do not need to participate in killing the Greench himself in order to complete the quest objectives.

{{Classic only-section|4.3.0}}
In {{Expac|Classic}}, the Greench needs to be killed as he drops [[Stolen Treats]] directly for [[You're a Mean One... (Alliance Classic)]] / [[You're a Mean One... (Horde Classic)]].

